/// origination phone number before you can send SMS messages to US phone
/// numbers. If you use SMS text messages in Amazon Cognito, you must
/// register a phone number with Amazon Pinpoint . Amazon Cognito uses the
/// registered number automatically. Otherwise, Amazon Cognito users who
/// must receive SMS messages might not be able to sign up, activate their
